From: Micheal Waltz <micheal@ecliptik.com>
Date: Thu, 14 May 2026 11:07:25 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] perf phase 11 patch 0139 -- wave-46 default OPL3 backend
 (production-ready)

Wave-44 OPL3 baseline iter shipped + measured (operator real-HW):
- +8.77 fps median at canonical Mimiga BK_PARALLAX heavy-music
  vs organya baseline (35.71 → 44.48 fps)
- Operator perceptual preference: PLAY1 (OPL3 + WiiMidi source)
  "sounds closest to original" + clean playback across all canonical
  scenes (per docs/internal/WAVE-44-OPL3-LOG-ANALYSIS.md § 2)
- Three follow-on issues identified (§ 5+6+7): Shack-scene MIDI
  stop (→ patch 0141 patch-bank loader); wub-wub post-quit artifact
  (→ SDL/0059 DSP RESET); 8-patch placeholder aesthetic ceiling
  (→ patch 0141 fixes when .dat data file lands)

Promote OPL3 from opt-in (SDL_HINT_DOSKUTSU_AUDIO_BACKEND=opl3) to
production default. AudioBackend.cpp env-unset branch now:
- selected = NXE::Diag::AudioBackend::opl3 (was: organya)
- LOG_INFO updated to narrate the wave-46 default promotion +
  preserve documentation of the override path

Fallback chain preserved bit-for-bit:
- SoundManager::init probes OPL3 via SDL_DOSOpl3Detect at runtime
- On probe failure (no SB16/Vibra16S/AdLib chip; OPL3 disabled in
  config; etc.), gracefully falls back to organya with clear LOG_INFO
- Pixtone SFX continues on SB16 DAC unchanged regardless

User override path unchanged:
- SDL_HINT_DOSKUTSU_AUDIO_BACKEND=organya restores Cave Story 2004
  original synth (full audio fidelity; loses ~8.77 fps in heavy music)
- SDL_HINT_DOSKUTSU_AUDIO_BACKEND=wb selects WaveBlaster (hardware
  MIDI on DreamBlaster S2; probe-and-fallback)
- SDL_HINT_DOSKUTSU_AUDIO_BACKEND=auto runs the WB→OPL3→organya
  chain (probe-driven selection; opt-in only)

MIDI source default unchanged (already wiimidi = data/midi/ since
patch 0107; operator-preferred per WAVE-44 § 2 vs orgmid set).
GM_VARIANT default unchanged (unset = no v1/v2 retune; operator-
preferred per WAVE-44 § 3 sub-noise A/B).

WB probe lockup risk (the original 2026-05-06 patch 0105 "TEMPORARY
revert to organya" trigger) is sidestepped: OPL3 probe is Adlib
timer-1 sequence on the SB16 base port (reliable + ~10 ms worst-
case timeout vs WB's known indefinite spinwait on real DreamBlaster
S2). The wave-44 iter validated OPL3 probe success on real HW
(operator's Vibra16S CT2490).

Ride-along iter wave-46-opl3-prod ships this patch + SDL/0059 (DSP
RESET wub-wub fix) + patch 0141 (Phase 10.5 patch-bank loader).
Banner regex addition for tests/run-gameplay-smoke.sh BANNERS array:
"audio backend: opl3 \(default since wave 46 patch 0139".

Update CHANGELOG.md [Unreleased] section with wave-46 entry summarizing
the 3-patch bundle (commit ride-along; not in this vendor commit).
